{"about_the_game":"The makers of Manufactoria return with a new open-ended puzzle game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684270/extras/ebbb0e1d54bced74b8de0458f68f0a1e.poster.avif?t=1635015162\" width=580 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684270/extras/ebbb0e1d54bced74b8de0458f68f0a1e.webm?t=1635015162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684270/extras/ebbb0e1d54bced74b8de0458f68f0a1e.mp4?t=1635015162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build complex electronics from a variety of simple components, like Adders, Latches and Multiplexers.<br></li><li>Travel back to the 60s to Silicon Valley's very first startup, and do your best to keep the whole thing from imploding.<br></li><li>Solve more than seventy puzzles, from straightforward introductions to building fully functional CPUs.<br></li><li>Original soundtrack by Craig Barnes, composer for <i>Streets of Rogue</i> and <i>Enyo</i>.</li></ul><br>&quot;The best game about CPU design that I can imagine\u200b&quot; -- Zach Barth (SpaceChem, TIS-100).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684270/extras/3020588a61748a2b05155025d514171b.poster.avif?t=1635015162\" width=580 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684270/extras/3020588a61748a2b05155025d514171b.webm?t=1635015162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/684270/extras/3020588a61748a2b05155025d514171b.mp4?t=1635015162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a3adee24ed3737d77e1d299